  "items": [
    {
      "name": "Why this pain isn't just a bad period",
      "char_file": "근육경련_illust.jpg",
      "body": [
        "About one in ten women",
        "of reproductive age",
        "has endometriosis",
        "",
        "Tissue that acts like",
        "the uterine lining",
        "grows outside it —",
        "on the ovaries, fallopian tubes,",
        "or pelvic lining",
        "",
        "Every month, that misplaced tissue",
        "still responds to estrogen,",
        "triggering bleeding, inflammation,",
        "and scar tissue where it doesn't belong"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "How this pain differs from typical cramps",
      "char_file": "달력_illust.jpg",
      "body": [
        "Typical menstrual cramps",
        "come and go with your period",
        "",
        "Endometriosis pain often continues",
        "before and after your period,",
        "and radiates to your",
        "lower back or thighs",
        "",
        "It can also show up",
        "during sex or bowel movements"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "The fertility connection",
      "char_file": "아기_illust.jpg",
      "body": [
        "About 40% of women",
        "with endometriosis",
        "experience infertility",
        "",
        "Among women being treated",
        "for infertility,",
        "25% to 50%",
        "turn out to have the condition"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "First, watch out for this fat",
      "char_file": "튀김_illust.jpg",
      "body": [
        "A 12-year Harvard study",
        "followed over 100,000 nurses",
        "and found two fats",
        "that move the needle",
        "",
        "Trans fat raises risk",
        "by 48%",
        "",
        "The biggest sources were",
        "fried foods eaten outside the home —",
        "especially french fries,",
        "margarine, and crackers"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Second, add more of this fat",
      "char_file": "연어_illust.jpg",
      "body": [
        "Long-chain omega-3",
        "fatty acids cut risk",
        "",
        "Women with the highest",
        "omega-3 intake were",
        "22% less likely to be diagnosed",
        "than those with the lowest intake"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Don't just wait out the pain",
      "char_file": "시계_illust.jpg",
      "body": [
        "If your pain lingers",
        "well past your period,",
        "or shows up during sex",
        "or bowel movements —",
        "",
        "Don't just wait it out,",
        "talk to a gynecologist",
        "",
        "Cutting back on fried food",
        "and adding more fatty fish",
        "like salmon can support",
        "your treatment plan too"
      ]
    }
  ],
